 "nl": [
  "hr must accept NTP (UDP 123) and SSH (TCP 22) from cameras.",
  "ops must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and RTSP (TCP 554) from backup.",
  "ops must accept NTP (UDP 123) from hr.",
  "Restrict cameras so that its only permitted destinations are database on HTTPS (TCP 443); library on syslog (UDP 514); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow research to connect to hr using SMB (TCP 445) and SSH (TCP 22) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "student-lab must accept SMB (TCP 445) and RDP (TCP 3389) from backup.",
  "No packet from cameras may enter backup, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow engineering to connect to research using LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "finance must accept LDAP (TCP 389) from library.",
  "Deny all traffic from backup to research (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow nvr to connect to admin using DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) on dmz-web reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Deny all traffic from nvr to ops (this overrides any public service).",
  "Hosts in backup may reach engineering over HTTPS (TCP 443) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "Permit any UDP port from mail to finance but deny TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Block TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161) from mail to database; the rest of any UDP port between them is allowed."
 ],
